# Regression test for #8921
# Verify that console works in a pipelined multi-project build.
# Before the fix, subproject/console threw FileSystemException (Windows) and
# all platforms got "Canceling execution..." / InterruptedException in the REPL.

# First compile the project normally to ensure pipelining works
> compile

# Verify pipelining flags are present in compile scope (pipelining is active)
> subproject/show scalacOptions

# Verify pipelining flags are ABSENT in console scope (fix is working)
> subproject/show console/scalacOptions

# Verify console opens without error (the main fix)
> subproject/console
> console
